Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:12.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Five each.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:13.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Then ten each.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:13.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Every outfield
