Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:16.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}to the goalkeepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:17.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Rulli stepped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:18.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}up and scored.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:18.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Then David de
