Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:20.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}saved a single
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:21.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}kick all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:21.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:22.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}he hadn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:22.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}saved a penalty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:23.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in five years.
